        "chr_0035_liino_UltimateSkill": {
            "Icon": "skillicon/icon_ultimate_skill_liino_01",
            "Element": "Pulse",
            "Name": "Dawnstar Concerto",
            "Desc": "Liino grants <@ba.heal>HP Treatment</> to the entire team, enters her <@ba.key>Cosmovoice Stance</> at the same time, unleashes a continuous display of Stage Pyrotechnics that deals <@ba.pulse>Electric DMG</>, and then triggers an <@ba.key>Electrifying Extravaganza</> that deals <@ba.pulse>Electric DMG</> and forcibly applies <#ba.conduct>Electrification</> to enemies in a large area of effect (AOE).\n<@ba.key>Cosmovoice Stance</>: This stance replaces Liino's <@ba.key>Vocalist Stance</>. While active, the stance grants the entire team <#ba.pulseenhance>Electric Amp</> and <#ba.naturalenhance>Nature Amp</> (effects are further increased by the attribute of Will) as well as an ATK Boost. The beats of Liino's song also deal <@ba.pulse>Electric DMG</> to enemies in the AOE and grant continuous <@ba.heal>HP Treatment</> to allied operators in the AOE. When the stance ends, deals 3 times the DMG from a single beat to enemies in the AOE, and grants 3 times the HP treatment from a single beat to the entire team. This effect does not trigger if the stance is ended early. \nDuring the stance, her battle skill is replaced with End Stance. <@ba.info>Casting the battle skill during Cosmovoice Stance ends it early and does not consume any SP.</>",
